    "Pinned mapped-caller audit found 47 unique direct calls, no tail callers and no EAX/AX/AL/AH consumers before clobber or path end. Four apparent consumers read subsequent Dialog init results with physical xor eax,eax. No absolute target DWORD found in raw-backed sections. This is bounded mapped-caller evidence, not whole-image dynamic reachability proof; reconstructed mangled labels alone are not evidence.",
    "Authorize void ListBox close preserving both base calls and all reset ordering. Source-owned synthetic destroy relay has no ORIGINAL identity or current caller; history traces it to retired destructor redirects. Remove its declaration/definition and update stale active include comment only; retain archived history. Inspect final emitted body and all header-consumer objects.",
    "Preserve every ORIGINAL identity and historical claim. Update symbol binding through package source writer. Coordinator authorizes temporary structural matching regression with explicit restoration obligation if encountered; never demote, overwrite baseline or claim acceptance. Native build/link, mapped measurements, claim/reference continuity, lifetime controls and physical collateral review precede manual integration."
  ],
